{"id":"00201","root":"uni00201_1","name":{"ja":"ツバキ","en":"Tsubaki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ツバキ","en":"Tsubaki"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-06-13","limited":true,"characterId":155,"profile":{"ja":"抜け忍となった元対魔忍。戦闘中、死に瀕しながら、息絶える寸前に魔の力に目覚め、超人的な力で敵を倒して窮地を脱する。こうして生き延びたものの、対魔忍側の記録では戦死とされた。以来彼女は対魔忍として生きるのを辞め、魔に堕ちた。苗字はその時に捨て、現在は『ツバキ』と名前だけを名乗っている。自らの血液を操る能力で戦う。血液を凝縮させた血の弾を放ったり、拳に纏ったり、相手を拘束したりと多様な戦い方ができるが、材料が自分の血であるため、使える血液量は決まっていた。だが、魔の力に目覚めてからは、相手の傷口から血を奪ってそれを武器にしたり、自身の治癒に使ったりすることもできるようになる。また自身の血の流れを加速させて超人的な身体能力を得、敵を高速のうちに倒すことも可能になった。","en":"(Tsubaki, she/her) Once a former Taimanin who turned rogue, she would awaken to demonic power at the brink of death during battle, using superhuman strength to defeat foes and escape peril. Though she survived, official Taimanin records listed her as killed in action. Since then she has abandoned the Taimanin path, fallen to demonhood, and discarded her surname, now going simply by \"Tsubaki.\" She fights by manipulating her own blood—launching condensed blood projectiles, coating her fists, or restraining opponents. Because the material is her own blood, the amount she can use is limited. However, after awakening to demonic power, she can siphon blood from her enemies' wounds to weaponize or heal herself, and accelerate her own blood flow to gain superhuman physical abilities, allowing her to dispatch enemies at incredible speed."},"illustrator":"なまにくATK","voiceActor":"かぐや凜子","forms":[{"id":"uni00201_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[138,276],"def":[112,224],"spd":[86,86],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","220001"],"evolve":[["evo00001",5],["evo00002",15],["evo00003",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00201_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[211,422],"def":[159,318],"spd":[86,86],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","220